window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Will the Ancients secure their everlasting reign, or can the immortals truly be stopped?</b></p> <p>As continents clash and races either unite or crumble, alliances become the key to survival. But in a world rife with traps and betrayal, which allies can be trusted?</p> <p>For Tarak, the time for mischief and games is over. To save a world on the brink of destruction, he must uncover the origin of all sorcery. But unlocking its secrets comes with a price. Faced with challenges unlike any before this, Tarak will be tested in ways no one else has. As the Protector, he must decide: What is he willing to sacrifice to defeat an unstoppable foe?</p> <p>This is the grand finale, bringing together every story that has come before it in this shared world.</p>"; 
